  destinations:
  - destinationName: Cloud Garden
    description: 'Soft clouds bloom like floating gardens high above the world below.

      Colorful
      flowers sway gently in the cool sky breeze.

      Hidden pathways connect
      magical islands drifting through the heavens.

      Every step feels lighter
      than air.'
    background: {fileID: -5469876113357775020, guid: c5da83ea7c62e4c70b4d13dbf821fb58, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Rainbow Bridge
    description: 'A magnificent rainbow stretches across the endless sky, connecting
      magical lands.

      Brilliant colors light your path toward exciting new
      adventures.

      Cross shimmering arches while discovering hidden surprises
      along the way.

      Every journey begins with a touch of magic.'
    background: {fileID: 6278825603142385126, guid: 6acf8d42fda9941b29657d9bc0d7d09e, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Floating Islands
    description: 'Ancient islands drift peacefully among the clouds, untouched by
      time.

      Each floating world hides unique treasures and breathtaking scenery.

      Explore
      mysterious pathways suspended high above the horizon.

      Adventure reaches
      new heights with every discovery.'
    background: {fileID: 7619248319715371830, guid: 11679d57d086249f491a13b4df5575ac, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Crystal Castle
    description: 'A dazzling castle built from shimmering crystals stands proudly
      among the clouds.

      Sunlight dances across every tower, filling the kingdom
      with radiant colors.

      Hidden chambers guard magical secrets waiting to
      be uncovered.

      Every puzzle unlocks another piece of this sparkling wonder.'
    background: {fileID: 435491305517117919, guid: a1b035435568d4ae5b248b62bd98256f, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Sky Temple
    description: 'An ancient temple floats peacefully above the clouds, protected
      by timeless magic.

      Marble pathways lead through sacred halls filled
      with mystery and beauty.

      Solve challenging puzzles to reveal forgotten
      legends.

      Every step brings you closer to the heart of the heavens.'
    background: {fileID: -811428147901337123, guid: 634dfb96fe1f94c4aafa481f800a3aac, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Sun Palace
    description: 'The grand Sun Palace shines brilliantly at the highest point of
      the Sky Kingdom.

      Golden halls glow with warmth as clouds drift peacefully
      below.

      Celebrate your incredible journey through every world as you
      uncover its final secrets.

      Only the greatest explorers earn the honor
      of reaching this majestic destination.'
    background: {fileID: 6072248598735154451, guid: b5bdf6481ff0642ba8ad316453f5c739, type: 3}
